          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Hidden Movement"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "If the choker starts its turn hidden from or undetected by a creature, that creature is flat-footed against the choker's attacks until the end of the turn.\n\nStrangling Fingers Any creature hit by a choker's arm Strike is automatically grabbed, and the choker begins to strangle the target. The creature is suffocating and can't speak as long as it's strangled.\n\nThis prevents it from casting spells with a verbal component or activating items with a command component."
            },
